160 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 87 0 R
/E (The monthly line chart shows December as the highest point in both 2024 and 2025, with prices climbing in the final months of each year. In 2025, price levels sit clearly above those of 2024 for most of the year, which shows that cost pressure was not only seasonal but also built up from one year to the next.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
161 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 87 0 R
/E (This pattern is a useful signal for cost budgeting and for timing new openings. A business planning to enter a province can expect higher operating costs toward year end and adjust its budget and launch schedule accordingly. Switching between years on the dashboard makes it easy to compare how this rhythm changes.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
