168 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 88 0 R
/E (DKI Jakarta works as the core value market, with the strongest wages and low price pressure. Jawa Barat and its neighbors are the volume markets, best suited to scale-driven models. Papua and Kepulauan Bangka Belitung are niche premium options, and the highest-pressure provinces, such as Maluku Utara and Sulawesi Tengah, belong on the watchlist.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
169 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
