/E (Limitations and Next Steps)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
170 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 88 0 R
/E (The wage data is a provincial minimum wage, not average income, and the price index is relative to 2022 rather than a direct inflation rate or a measure of absolute cost of living. The Market_Score weights are a modeling choice and would need business validation. Next steps are adding a year-on-year inflation measure, sector-level demand, and company-specific cost data.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
